# Spacing Scale (8px)

When creating new elements or setting margin/padding, use multiples of **8** only.

Valid values: `0`, `8`, `16`, `24`, `32`, `40`, `48`, etc.

```scss
// ❌ BAD
margin: 10px;
padding: 12px 20px;

// ✅ GOOD
margin: 8px;
padding: 16px 24px;
```

Also apply this to gap, inset, and similar spacing properties when adding new styles.
